menu "Camera module SDK, extended layer (camera_sys.h)"

    config CAMERA_SIG_OFFSET
        int "First signal of the camera, counted from MAX_SIG"
        range 1000 60000
        default 1200
        help
            camera_sys.h posts its signals to Active Objects of the app, and
            an Active Object cannot publish, so they are all direct-post ones
            in a range of their own: CAMERA_SIG_FIRST = MAX_SIG + this. The
            module SDKs have Mesh 1000, Robotics 1100, Camera 1200 and F*CK
            1300, so that an app can use more than one. An app's own signals
            go from MAX_SIG to MAX_SIG + 999. The range must fit a QSignal
            (16 bits); a build that does not stops.

endmenu
